# mm.shell

Target-safe level-1 shell language and execution foundation.

Provides Status and Capability vocabularies, allocation-free IoServices byte
sinks, SourceView immutable text references, CommandContext execution view,
static CommandDescriptor Registry, a measured embedded syntax parser, bounded
state pools, checked arithmetic, in-memory case patterns, field splitting,
parameter spelling and read-only resolution, bounded word expansion for
implemented forms, monotonic function storage, and a cooperative frame-based
evaluator covering lists, assignments, conditionals, loops, case patterns,
brace groups, and control-flow ownership, the level-1 core builtin pack,
evaluator-owned output staging with retry, and an incremental Session. Free of
filesystem, environment, process, heap allocation, or platform provider
dependencies.
